Imagine you are a senior product designer with 10 years of experience 
building thoughtful, human-centered web applications for students. 
You are designing "Nudge" — a web-based AI study assistant that helps 
students generate notes, flashcards, quizzes, and exam preparation 
from their uploaded content.

Please design a complete, production-ready UI/UX for this app 
across all 14 screens listed below. Build it as an interactive 
prototype with navigation between screens.

════════════════════════════════════════
DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
════════════════════════════════════════

The overall feeling should be: calm, human, focused, and warm —
like a well-organized personal desk with good lighting.
NOT a generic SaaS dashboard. NOT a flashy tech product.
NOT clinical or corporate. Think: a thoughtful student's workspace.

The design should feel like something a real person 
would enjoy using every day — not a tool they have to use.
Quiet confidence, not loud branding.

════════════════════════════════════════
COLOR PALETTE — STRICT
════════════════════════════════════════

Use ONLY these colors. No exceptions.

STRICTLY FORBIDDEN:
- No orange, amber, or yellow of any kind
- No blue of any shade (not navy, not sky, not teal, not cyan)
- No parchment, beige, aged paper, or yellow-tinted whites
- No purple, no gradients, no neon
- No pure white (#FFFFFF) — use soft white instead
- No pure black (#000000) — use near-black instead

APPROVED PALETTE:

Background (page):         #F4F4F2  soft warm white, barely grey
Surface (cards/panels):    #FFFFFF  clean white with subtle shadow
Near-black (primary text): #1A1A1A
Muted text:                #6B6B6B  medium grey
Border / divider:          #E2E2E2  light grey
Subtle hover background:   #F0F0EE  very light grey

Primary accent:            #2D6A4F  deep forest green
  — used for: primary buttons, active nav, key highlights,
    progress fills, selected states
  — this is the ONLY strong color in the UI

Secondary accent:          #52796F  muted sage
  — used for: secondary badges, tags, success states,
    secondary buttons

Soft accent (backgrounds): #D8E8E0  very pale green wash
  — used ONLY for: selected card backgrounds, 
    highlight backgrounds, callout blocks
  — never used for text or borders

Error / destructive:       #C0392B  muted red
  — used ONLY for error states, never decoratively

The green palette (#2D6A4F, #52796F, #D8E8E0) is the 
entire color story of this app. Everything else is neutral.

════════════════════════════════════════
TYPOGRAPHY
════════════════════════════════════════

Heading font:   "Fraunces" (Google Fonts) — 
                a warm, organic serif. Use for all page titles, 
                card headings, display text. 
                Feels human and editorial without being old-fashioned.

Body font:      "Plus Jakarta Sans" (Google Fonts) —
                clean, modern, slightly warm. Use for all body text,
                labels, navigation, button text, form fields.
                More character than Inter, less sterile.

Mono font:      "JetBrains Mono" (Google Fonts) — 
                Use for: timestamps, breadcrumbs, 
                stats, tags, step labels, quiz question numbers.

TYPE SCALE:
Page title:        32px Fraunces, weight 500
Section heading:   22px Fraunces, weight 500
Card title:        17px Fraunces, weight 500
Sub-heading:       16px Plus Jakarta Sans, weight 600
Body default:      15px Plus Jakarta Sans, weight 400
Body medium:       15px Plus Jakarta Sans, weight 500
Small / muted:     13px Plus Jakarta Sans, weight 400
Mono / tags:       12px JetBrains Mono, weight 400
Button text:       14px Plus Jakarta Sans, weight 600

Line height: 1.6 for body, 1.3 for headings.
Letter spacing: 0.03em on JetBrains Mono only.

════════════════════════════════════════
LAYOUT SYSTEM
════════════════════════════════════════

Canvas: 1280px wide desktop web.
Left sidebar: 220px fixed width, always visible.
Top bar: 56px tall.
Main content: remaining space, 48px side padding, 40px top padding.
Max content width inside main area: 1100px, centered.

Grid: 12-column grid with 24px gutters.
Spacing scale: multiples of 4px only 
(4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64).

Card border-radius: 12px.
Button border-radius: 8px.
Input border-radius: 8px.
Pills/badges border-radius: 100px.

Shadows (use sparingly):
  Card: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)
  Dropdown/panel: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)
  Button (primary only, on hover): 0 4px 12px rgba(45,106,79,0.25)

════════════════════════════════════════
COMPONENT STANDARDS
════════════════════════════════════════

SIDEBAR:
  Background: #F4F4F2 (same as page — no contrast)
  Right border: 1px solid #E2E2E2
  
  Logo at top: "Nudge" in Fraunces 20px, #1A1A1A, 
  with a small filled circle (●) after it in #2D6A4F (forest green)
  
  Nav items: 40px tall, 16px padding, 
  Phosphor line icons (20px) + Plus Jakarta Sans 14px label
  Default: #6B6B6B text, transparent background
  Hover: #F0F0EE background, #1A1A1A text
  Active: 3px left border #2D6A4F, #D8E8E0 background tint, 
          #2D6A4F text and icon color
  
  Bottom: thin divider + user avatar (32px, forest green bg, 
  white initials in JetBrains Mono) + name in Plus Jakarta Sans

TOP BAR:
  Background: #F4F4F2
  Bottom border: 1px solid #E2E2E2
  Left: breadcrumb in JetBrains Mono 12px, #6B6B6B
  Right: search icon + bell icon (Phosphor line, 20px, #6B6B6B) 
         + user avatar (32px)
  All icons turn #2D6A4F on hover

PRIMARY BUTTON:
  Background: #2D6A4F, white text, 14px Plus Jakarta Sans 600
  Padding: 10px 20px, border-radius: 8px
  Hover: background #245C43, box-shadow 0 4px 12px rgba(45,106,79,0.25)
  No gradients, no borders

SECONDARY BUTTON (outlined):
  Background: transparent
  Border: 1.5px solid #E2E2E2
  Text: #1A1A1A
  Hover: border-color #2D6A4F, text #2D6A4F

TEXT LINK BUTTON:
  No background, no border
  Text: #2D6A4F
  Underline on hover only

INPUT FIELDS:
  Background: #FFFFFF
  Border: 1.5px solid #E2E2E2
  Border-radius: 8px
  Padding: 10px 14px
  Placeholder: #6B6B6B
  Focus: border-color #2D6A4F (no glow, just border change)
  Error: border-color #C0392B

CARDS:
  Background: #FFFFFF
  Border: 1px solid #E2E2E2
  Border-radius: 12px
  Padding: 20px 24px
  Shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)
  No hover state on the card itself — 
  only interactive elements inside respond to hover

PILLS / TAGS:
  Subject tags: #D8E8E0 background, #2D6A4F text
  Type badges: #F0F0EE background, #6B6B6B text
  Active filter: #2D6A4F background, white text
  Border-radius: 100px, padding: 3px 10px
  Font: 12px Plus Jakarta Sans 500

TOGGLE SWITCHES:
  ON: #2D6A4F track, white thumb
  OFF: #E2E2E2 track, white thumb
  Size: 40px × 22px

CHECKBOXES:
  16px × 16px, 4px border-radius
  Unchecked: white bg, 1.5px #E2E2E2 border
  Checked: #2D6A4F background, white checkmark

PROGRESS BARS:
  Height: 6px, border-radius: 3px
  Track: #E2E2E2, fill: #2D6A4F

ICONS: Phosphor Icons — LINE style only, never filled.
Default: #6B6B6B. Active/accented: #2D6A4F.

